      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport zlib\n\n\ndef hash_buckets(text, buckets):\n    vector = [0] * buckets\n    for word in text.lower().split():\n        vector[zlib.crc32(word.encode()) % buckets] += 1\n    return vector\n\nprint(hash_buckets(\"the cat sat on the mat\", 8))\nprint(hash_buckets(\"data data data\", 4))\n```"
